~Version Information
VERS. 2.0 : LAS version
WRAP. NO : One line per depth sample
~Well Information
STRT.M 1000.0 : Start depth
STOP.M 1000.5 : Stop depth
STEP.M 0.5 : Depth step
NULL. -999.25 : Missing value
WELL. DEMO WELL : Well name
~Curve Information
DEPT.M : Depth
GR.API : Gamma ray
RT.OHMM : Resistivity
RHOB.G/C3 : Bulk density
NPHI.V/V : Neutron porosity
~ASCII
1000.0 50.0 10.0 2.45 0.20
1000.5 -999.25 12.0 2.50 0.18
